is and their mothers were abstracted from DOHMH’s surveillance and case management registry\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"five-year American Community Survey poverty data from 2011 to 2015 were used to divide zip code tabulation areas into four categories\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Calculation of the percent of pregnant women by country of birth excludes women for whom country of birth was unknown\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"UHF neighborhoods are ranked on an annual basis according to the case rate of early latent syphilis among females\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}